graph TD
    subgraph S1 ["1. 工作区 (Working Tree)"]
        W["你的办公桌\n随时在上面写字涂改代码"]
    end

    subgraph S2 ["2. 暂存区 (Staging Area)"]
        S["打包快递纸箱\n执行 git add：把满意的修改装进纸箱"]
    end

    subgraph S3 ["3. 本地仓库 (Local Repo)"]
        L["自家地下室货架\n执行 git commit：给纸箱贴上封条编号存档"]
    end

    subgraph S4 ["4. 远程仓库 (GitHub)"]
        R["全球云端总仓库\n执行 git push：顺丰寄到云端备份"]
    end

    W -->|git add| S
    S -->|git commit| L
    L -->|git push| R

%% Academic palette: restrained blue, teal, gold, violet, and coral accents.
style W fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3A6EA5,color:#17324D
style S fill:#E7F5F1,stroke:#2B8A78,color:#17324D
style L fill:#FFF4DC,stroke:#B47A1F,color:#17324D
style R fill:#F0EBFA,stroke:#7357A6,color:#17324D
